  skillName: Reflection
  skillDescription: 'Fires a spinning blade that is<color=#98FB98><b> 1 units long</b></color>
    and<color=#98FB98><b> 1 unit wide</b></color> in <color=#FFD700><b> 6 directions</b></color>.
    The blade <color=#a8d8ea><b>travels (n) distance</b></color>, stops for 1 second,
    then returns to the ship. The blade <color=#FAA0A0><b>hits 3 times per second</b></color>,
    <color=#FF0000><b>dealing 5 damage per hit</b></color>.

    

    Cooldown:
    <color=#DBDBDB><b>15 sec</b></color>.'
